---
description: Generally do not open a browser, screenshot, or record the screen
alwaysApply: true
---

Do not open a browser, take screenshots, or record the screen by default.
Verify with scripts, API checks, and terminal logs.
Open a browser only when the user explicitly asks, or when frontend code in this repository changed and scripts cannot prove the result.
This project rule overrides any user rule that requires browser verification for all web UI or copy changes (including remote Open WebUI banners).
